IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPLITFUSE-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PROMPT-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CHUNK-BUDGET        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PROMPT-CHUNKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPLITFUSE-V3.
    IF CHUNK-BUDGET == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE PROMPT-TOKENS TO PROMPT-CHUNKS.
    DIVIDE CHUNK-BUDGET INTO PROMPT-CHUNKS.
    IF PROMPT-CHUNKS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO PROMPT-CHUNKS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PROMPT-CHUNKS.
    WEIGHT 30 DECODE-TOKENS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
